<title>UK: Dwyer Estates sells London office building.</title>
<headline>Dwyer Estates sells London office building.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-03-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Britain's Dwyer Estates Plc said on Monday it had exchanged contracts to sell a London office building to Foraksringsbolaget SPP for 10.2 million stg in cash.</p>
<p>Annual rental income from the property at 6/8 Alie Street was about 1.1 million stg, the company said in a statement.</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7717</p>
